*=======================================================================
* SPICE Model Library for MOSFET Transistors  (N and P)
* Created:      15/07/2026
* Last update:   08/08/2026
* Author:   DSpice 
*=======================================================================


* NMOS Model
.model NMOS NMOS (
+ LEVEL=1
+ VTO=0.7
+ KP=120u
+ LAMBDA=0.02
+ W=5u L=1u)


* PMOS Model
.model PMOS PMOS (
+ LEVEL=1
+ VTO=-0.7
+ KP=40u
+ LAMBDA=0.02
+ W=10u L=1u)